fighting the wizard (and having a tough time, despite the fact that this is
a good character - for one thing, my stupid pet Archon won't attack him!)
when suddenly "The Wizard points at you and curses. A malignant aura surrounds
you. You collapse under your load." Yep, he cursed one of my bags (actually,
