cursed). The bag was very, very heavily loaded, so this basically made me
paralyzed for a long, long time. Needless to say, I was surrounded by the Wiz
and his pets and didn't last very long. The battle wasn't going great anyway,
but I think I would have won it had he not cursed the stupid bag! ARGH!

